# Prettier must not touch this project.
#
# Every file here is hand-formatted, and the formatting carries meaning: the
# HTML is indented two spaces with attributes kept on one line so a tag reads
# as a single thought, and style.css is ordered and commented as prose for a
# reader rather than grouped the way a tool would group it.
#
# Left to itself, the editor's Prettier reformatted shop.html and terms.html on
# save - lowercasing <!doctype html>, self-closing void elements, switching to
# four-space indent and wrapping attributes at 80 columns. That was about 1,540
# changed lines across two files, none of them a change anyone asked for, and it
# buried the real diff. There is no Prettier config in this repo, so the setting
# driving it belongs to the editor; this file is what stops it at the door.
#
# Ignoring everything is deliberate. An allowlist would quietly start
# reformatting whatever gets added next.
*
